# title: European call
# category: Vanillas and digitals
# underlyings: 1
# source: Black & Scholes, The Pricing of Options and Corporate Liabilities, Journal of Political Economy, 1973
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: The right to buy the stock at its strike-date level one year later: pays the rise of the stock over that level, nothing if it fell.
#
# Strike: 100% of the level on the strike date (at the money).
# Paid in the stock's currency, per share.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays max(spot() - s0, 0)
